    "description": {
      "value": "<p><em>General Feat (Prerequisite: Level 4+)</em></p><p>You gain the following benefits.</p><p><strong>Ability Score Increase.</strong> Increase your Intelligence, Wisdom, or Charisma score by 1, to a maximum of 20.</p><p><strong>Sacred Magic.</strong> You learn the @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells24.Item.phbsplLight00000]{Light} cantrip, and you can cast it without Material components; if you already know it, you learn another Cleric cantrip of your choice. Its spellcasting ability is the ability increased by this feat.</p><p><strong>Solar Luminance.</strong> When you cast Light, you can make its light sunlight. Once you use this benefit, you can't use it again until you finish a Long Rest.</p><p><strong>Sun's Healing.</strong> As a Bonus Action while in sunlight, you can expend one of your Hit Point Dice, roll it, and regain Hit Points equal to the roll. Once you use this benefit, you can't use it again until you finish a Short or Long Rest.</p>",
